## Model card

- **Name:** Gemini 3.1 Pro
- **Short description:** Google's foundational Gemini 3 series model, a smarter model for complex tasks, natively multimodal and reasoning-capable, processing text, visual, and audio inputs.
- **Provider / access:** Google AI Studio, Vertex AI (https://deepmind.google/models/gemini/)
- **Release / knowledge:** February 19, 2026 (official release), knowledge cutoff current
- **IDs:** google/gemini-3.1-pro
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 input tokens, 64,000 output tokens
- **Modalities:** text/image/audio/video in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calls; JSON mode
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-03):** $2.00/$4.00 per 1M tokens (input/output), paid tier available
- **Architecture:** Sparse mixture-of-experts transformer, proprietary

