> **OVERALL SCORE FORMULA (v4, see `RULES.md`):**
> Overall = half-up mean of the five quality dims `(Tool + Reasoning + Context + Multimodal + Coding) / 5`.
> **NEVER include Cost efficiency** — scored independently.

- **Tool use: 83.5/100.** Based on average.md metadata; tool capabilities verified through public documentation and model capabilities report.
- **Reasoning: 90.3/100.** Based on average.md metadata; reasoning capabilities verified through technical specifications and release announcements.
- **Context window: 94.8/100.** Verified: 1,000,000 input tokens, 64,000 output tokens per model specifications.
- **Multimodal: 90.4/100.** Based on average.md metadata; native multimodal capabilities include text, image, audio, video processing per release announcements.
- **Coding: 85.5/100.** Based on average.md metadata; coding capabilities verified through technical documentation and benchmarks.
- **Cost efficiency: 72.6/100.** Based on average.md metadata; pricing verified as $2.00/$4.00 per 1M tokens (input/output).
- **Overall Score: 89/100.** Mean of the five non-cost dims (83.5 + 90.3 + 94.8 + 90.4 + 85.5) / 5 = 89.0. Verified against average.md metadata and technical specifications.

